# Zahur, Glory's Past {W}{B}: "Sacrifice another creature: Surveil 1. Activate only once each turn." (CR 701.25a, 602.5b). Zahur is not
# offered as its own sacrifice, the Memnite sacrificed is a cost (it is in the graveyard when the surveil happens) and the Island on top
# is binned. A second activation the same turn is refused with another creature to sacrifice, and allowed on turn 3 (a new turn).
# At speed 1 the max speed ability is off (CR 702.178a, 702.179e): the dying Memnites make no Zombie.

